      "markdown": "## HOMOGENEOUS LINEAR SYSTEMS\n\nSolve for the basic variables  $ x_{1} $ and  $ x_{2} $ to obtain  $ x_{1}=\\frac{4}{3}x_{3} $,  $ x_{2}=0 $, with  $ x_{3} $ free.\n\n■ As a vector, the general solution of Ax = 0 has the form given below.\n\n $$ \\mathbf{x}=\\begin{bmatrix}x_{1}\\\\ x_{2}\\\\ x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\dfrac{4}{3}x_{3}\\\\ 0\\\\ x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}=x_{3}\\begin{bmatrix}\\dfrac{4}{3}\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}=x_{3}\\mathbf{v},where\\mathbf{v}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\dfrac{4}{3}\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} $$ ",
